A canteen billing program gives a discount on the total amount of an order. The rule is: total of ₹500 or more gets 10% off; total of ₹200 or more (but below ₹500) gets 5% off; smaller orders get no discount. The programmer wrote:
if total >= 500:
    disc = 0.10 * total
elif total >= 200:
    disc = 0.05 * total
else:
    disc = 0
print(total - disc)

